WEBVTT

00:34.020 --> 00:38.561
The atmosphere is thinning out tonight

00:41.061 --> 00:46.042
I'm drifting past the edge of the satellite

00:49.063 --> 00:53.644
A velvet curtain falling on the glass

00:56.104 --> 01:03.794
I watch the constellations slowly pass Sermon

01:03.874 --> 01:11.656
of velvet Painted in the black We crossed the

01:11.696 --> 01:19.899
line And we can't go back Caught in the orbit

01:21.779 --> 01:30.002
Losing the ground Floating away In the tide of

01:30.162 --> 01:30.742
sound

01:33.238 --> 01:52.214
Terminal Velvet

01:52.254 --> 01:56.117
The telemetry is quiet The screen is dark

01:59.478 --> 02:04.641
Just a fading memory of the final spark

02:07.903 --> 02:12.405
Gravity is losing its heavy hold

02:14.546 --> 02:17.328
Out in beautiful,

02:18.168 --> 02:20.089
silent cold

02:21.930 --> 02:30.075
Terminal valve is painted in black We crossed

02:30.155 --> 02:38.798
the line and we can't go back Caught in the orbit,

02:40.459 --> 02:49.582
losing the ground Floating away in tidal sound

02:51.922 --> 02:53.403
Terminal velvet

02:57.096 --> 03:02.862
No friction to slow us down No gravity to pull us

03:02.962 --> 03:07.306
to the ground Just the endless empty space

03:07.887 --> 03:11.891
Perfect frozen state of grace

03:48.126 --> 03:56.252
Terminal velvet Painted in the black We crossed

03:56.332 --> 04:04.639
the line And we can't go back Caught in the orbit

04:06.640 --> 04:14.906
Losing the ground Floating away In the tide of

04:15.026 --> 04:15.587
sound

04:18.110 --> 04:19.491
Terminal Velvet.

04:25.553 --> 04:27.614
Slowing away.

04:29.335 --> 04:30.796
Terminal Velvet.

